{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1165","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Almost All Divisors"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"We guessed some integer number $$$x$$$. You are given a list of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"almost all"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" its divisors. "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Almost all"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" means that there are "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"all divisors except $$$1$$$ and $$$x$$$"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in the list."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to find the minimum possible integer $$$x$$$ that can be the guessed number, or say that the input data is contradictory and it is impossible to find such number."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have to answer $$$t$$$ independent queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains one integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 25$$$) — the number of queries. Then $$$t$$$ queries follow."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the query contains one integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 300$$$) — the number of divisors in the list."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of the query contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$d_1, d_2, \\dots, d_n$$$ ($$$2 \\le d_i \\le 10^6$$$), where $$$d_i$$$ is the $$$i$$$-th divisor of the guessed number. It is guaranteed that all values $$$d_i$$$ are "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"distinct"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each query print the answer to it."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If the input data in the query is contradictory and it is impossible to find such number $$$x$$$ that the given list of divisors is the list of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"almost all"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" its divisors, print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"-1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". Otherwise print the minimum possible $$$x$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n8\n8 2 12 6 4 24 16 3\n1\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n48\n4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"1165D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1165/problem/D"}